WEBVTT

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:00.751
because they've mastered something
I wish everyone knew about work.

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:03.776
Today: remote work,

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:06.896
how we can communicate better
with and without a camera,

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:08.786
no potatoes required,

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:11.583
and how, even during
this unprecedented pandemic,

00:03:11.607 --> 00:03:13.066
we can stay resilient.

